keywords The Prison's Bindings, The Prison's Casing, Suppression, Daio the Decrepit, Tainted Scar, Satyr Blood, Wildspawn, Tears of the Hederine, Hederine, Glowing Crystal Prison, Doomguard Commander, Imprisoned Doomguard, Tome of Sacrifice, Dire Maul, Warpwood Quarter, Darkwhisper Gorge, Warlock, class quest
