why A rare off-hand at 60, Daio's payment for capturing a Doomguard Commander in the Blasted Lands.

# Daio the Decrepit's chain in the Tainted Scar: The Prison's Bindings (7581,
# 15 Satyr Blood from the Wildspawn of Dire Maul East), The Prison's Casing
# (7582, 5 Tears of the Hederine from Darkwhisper Gorge in Winterspring) and
# Suppression (7583, capturing a Doomguard Commander with the Glowing Crystal
# Prison), for the Tome of Sacrifice.
# Drops (items.json): Satyr Blood four times in five from every Wildspawn
# (55-56, elite); Tears of the Hederine four times in five from the Hederine
# Initiates, Manastalkers and Slayers (57-58, elite; player notes report
# fewer). The Doomguard Commander (61) is elite; the prison is a channel of
# about 20 seconds that his War Stomp can break, and when it completes he
# turns into the Imprisoned Doomguard, an object you click (quest notes).
# Dire Maul has no entrance positions in our data except the gate; the
# Warpwood Quarter's back door at Lariss Pavilion needs the Crescent Key,
# which drops inside Dire Maul East itself: first runs go in by the main
# entrance (Feralas 59.2,45.1, Forever's dungeon entrances).
# Neither reference class guide carries this chain.
# ASSUMED: The chain runs as in Classic (Classic flow; Forever's data has no play reports past the level-30 beta cap). In-game check: the prison's channel and the Imprisoned Doomguard object.
# Sources: Forever's quest data (quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json,
# items.json); the quest notes (data/local/mechanics) for the camps and the
# capture.

step Daio the Decrepit
  tip At 60 Daio the Decrepit waits in the Tainted Scar, the demon-filled hollow in the west of the Blasted Lands. The Scar is full of hard-hitting elites: Soulstone yourself first, then keep to the right-hand wall going in, or ride through mounted. Daio gives you two errands at once.
  level 60
  accept 7581                         -- Daio the Decrepit
  accept 7582

step Satyr Blood
  zone Feralas
  tip The Wildspawn satyrs (level 55-57, elite) fill the Warpwood Quarter, Dire Maul's eastern wing: bring a group of five. Four in five drop a blood, but they do not come back for two hours and one full clear may come up short of fifteen; reset and run it again. The back door at Lariss Pavilion needs the Crescent Key, which drops inside this wing; until someone has it, go in by Dire Maul's main gate in central Feralas.
  collect 18603 x15 quest 7581.1 @59.2,45.1 group 5 -- Satyr Blood, from the Wildspawn inside

step Tears of the Hederine
  zone Winterspring
  tip The Hederine demons (level 57-60, elite) hold Darkwhisper Gorge in the far south of Winterspring: grouping up is encouraged. Two Slayers guard the gorge past the bridge; the western tunnel leads to more Initiates, the easiest of them (watch for their Dominate Mind). A warlock can solo them one at a time with Fear or Banish and damage over time, but slowly. Any of them can drop the Tears, four kills in five.
  collect 18604 x5 quest 7582.1       -- Tears of the Hederine

step Suppression
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip Hand both in to Daio and take the Glowing Crystal Prison. Find a Doomguard Commander (level 61, elite) standing alone in the Tainted Scar, open from about 30 yards with your voidwalker on him, and channel the prison on him for about 20 seconds: he attacks you to break free, and his War Stomp can interrupt the channel, so sacrifice the voidwalker for its shield if you must. Grouping up is encouraged: a second player to tank makes it easy. When the channel finishes he becomes the Imprisoned Doomguard: click it. If the channel breaks, kill him or run, and try another.
  turnin 7581                         -- Daio the Decrepit
  turnin 7582                         -- Daio the Decrepit
  accept 7583
  use 18601 @34.5,63.7                -- Glowing Crystal Prison, on a Doomguard Commander
  collect 18605 quest 7583.1          -- Imprisoned Doomguard, click it

step Back to Daio
  turnin 7583                         -- Daio the Decrepit: Tome of Sacrifice
